---
const checkItems = [
  "Velocidad y rendimiento (PageSpeed Insights)",
  "Errores de SEO que Google puede estar penalizando",
  "Experiencia de usuario y usabilidad móvil",
];
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-950 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

      <div class="text-white">
        <span class="inline-block bg-purple-600 dark:bg-purple-800 text-purple-100 text-sm font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
          100% gratuito · Sin compromisos
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight">
          ¿Tu sitio web podría estar perdiendo clientes?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-purple-100 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Te envío un análisis gratuito de tu sitio web en menos de 48 horas, con los puntos exactos que están
          frenando que Google te muestre más y que tus visitantes se conviertan en clientes.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {
            checkItems.map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-purple-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-purple-300 shrink-0 text-lg" />
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <form
        action="https://formspree.io/f/moveodgj"
        method="POST"
        class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl space-y-5"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Solicitud de auditoría web gratuita" />
        <input type="hidden" name="tipo" value="auditoria_gratuita" />

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">
          Solicitar auditoría gratuita
        </h3>

        <div>
          <label
            for="audit_name"
            class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1"
          >
            Tu nombre
          </label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="audit_name"
            name="name"
            placeholder="Ej: María García"
            required
            class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 placeholder-gray-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-purple-500 outline-none transition duration-200"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label
            for="audit_email"
            class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1"
          >
            Tu correo electrónico
          </label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="audit_email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="tu@correo.com"
            required
            class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 placeholder-gray-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-purple-500 outline-none transition duration-200"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label
            for="audit_url"
            class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-1"
          >
            URL de tu sitio web
          </label>
          <input
            type="url"
            id="audit_url"
            name="website_url"
            placeholder="https://tusitio.com"
            required
            class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 placeholder-gray-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-purple-500 outline-none transition duration-200"
          />
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="w-full bg-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition duration-300 transform hover:scale-[1.01] shadow-md"
        >
          Quiero mi auditoría gratuita
        </button>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-center">
          Tu información es privada y nunca será compartida con terceros.
        </p>
      </form>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
